  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Our brand focuses on practical kitchen solutions designed to make everyday life easier. Our <strong>Kitchen Electric Heated Lunch Box</strong> allows users to enjoy warm, home-cooked meals anytime, anywhere. It is ideal for office workers, drivers, students, travelers, and anyone who wants a convenient and healthy alternative to fast food.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different:</p><ul><li><p>Fast and even heating for a hot meal in minutes</p></li><li><p>Safe, food-grade materials with leak-proof design</p></li><li><p>Portable, lightweight, and easy to carry</p></li><li><p>Energy-efficient and simple to use (plug &amp; heat)</p></li><li><p>Designed for daily use with durability and comfort in mind</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Affiliates earn commissions on every sale generated through their unique referral link. The more you promote, the more you earn. We offer competitive commission rates, reliable tracking, and timely payouts.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:</p><ul><li><p>Share product reviews and unboxing videos</p></li><li><p>Post lifestyle content on social media (office, travel, car use)</p></li><li><p>Write blog articles or comparison posts</p></li><li><p>Recommend the product in meal-prep or healthy-living content</p></li><li><p>Use before/after or daily routine demonstrations</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information:</p><ul><li><p>Suitable for work, travel, school, and outdoor use</p></li><li><p>Perfect gift idea for busy professionals</p></li><li><p>Customer support available for affiliates</p></li><li><p>Marketing materials and product images provided</p></li><li><p>High demand product with strong repeat interest</p></li></ul></div></div>",
